    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4057696177",
      "Source": "Congrats! The RNG gods have provided you with a<#RN#> <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Lucky XP charm!</><#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">Type:</> DinoCharm<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">Rank:</> Lesser<#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">Additional Stat Bonuses</><#RN#>Will boost your XP gain! by 1.5x",
      "Trans": {"SC":"恭喜！RNG 之神赐予了你一个<#RN#> <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">幸运经验 charm！</><#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">类型：</> 恐龙符咒<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">等级：</> 次级<#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">额外属性加成</><#RN#>将使你的经验获取提升 1.5 倍！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3905228958",
      "Source": "Congrats! The RNG gods have provided you with a<#RN#> <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Lucky Fall damage charm!</><#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">Type:</> DinoCharm<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">Rank:</> Lesser<#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">Additional Stat Bonuses</><#RN#>Will half your fall damage!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"恭喜！RNG 之神赐予了你一个<#RN#> <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">幸运坠落伤害 charm！</><#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">类型：</> 恐龙符咒<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">等级：</> 次级<#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">额外属性加成</><#RN#>将使你的坠落伤害减半！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2855566146",
      "Source": "Congrats! The RNG gods have provided you with a<#RN#> <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Lucky water charm!</><#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">Type:</> DinoCharm<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">Rank:</> Lesser<#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">Additional Stat Bonuses</><#RN#>Will slow down your oxygen use underwater!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"恭喜！RNG 之神赐予了你一个<#RN#> <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">幸运水 charm！</><#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">类型：</> 恐龙符咒<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">等级：</> 次级<#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">额外属性加成</><#RN#>将减缓你在水下的氧气消耗！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1043797817",
      "Source": "Congrats! The RNG gods have provided you with a<#RN#> <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Lucky Speed charm!</><#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">Type:</> DinoCharm<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">Rank:</> Lesser<#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">Additional Stat Bonuses</><#RN#>You will have increased speed!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"恭喜！RNG 之神赐予了你一个<#RN#> <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">幸运速度 charm！</><#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">类型：</> 恐龙符咒<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">等级：</> 次级<#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">额外属性加成</><#RN#>你将获得速度提升！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3138634202",
      "Source": "Congrats! The RNG gods have provided you with a<#RN#> <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Lucky Food charm!</><#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">Type:</> DinoCharm<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">Rank:</> Lesser<#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">Additional Stat Bonuses</><#RN#>This charm will keep you fed!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"恭喜！RNG 之神赐予了你一个<#RN#> <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">幸运食物 charm！</><#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">类型：</> 恐龙符咒<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">等级：</> 次级<#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">额外属性加成</><#RN#>这个符咒会让你保持饱腹！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::349048325",
      "Source": "Congrats! The RNG gods have provided you with a<#RN#> <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Lucky weight charm!</><#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">Type:</> DinoCharm<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">Rank:</> Lesser<#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">Additional Stat Bonuses</><#RN#>Will boost your weight by x2",
      "Trans": {"SC":"恭喜！RNG 之神赐予了你一个<#RN#> <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">幸运负重 charm！</><#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">类型：</> 恐龙符咒<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">等级：</> 次级<#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">额外属性加成</><#RN#>将使你的负重提升 2 倍","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::965489628",
      "Source": "Congrats! The RNG gods have provided you with a<#RN#> <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Lucky baby charm!</><#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">Type:</> DinoCharm<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">Rank:</> Lesser<#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">Additional Stat Bonuses</><#RN#>This will force your dinos to stay babies forever!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"恭喜！RNG 之神赐予了你一个<#RN#> <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">幸运幼崽 charm！</><#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">类型：</> 恐龙符咒<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">等级：</> 次级<#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">额外属性加成</><#RN#>这将迫使你的恐龙永远保持幼崽状态！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3882133575",
      "Source": "Congrats! The RNG gods have provided you with a<#RN#> <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Lucky Fall damage charm!</><#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">Type:</> DinoCharm<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">Rank:</> Lesser<#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">Additional Stat Bonuses</><#RN#>Will increase your healing by x2",
      "Trans": {"SC":"恭喜！RNG 之神赐予了你一个<#RN#> <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">幸运坠落伤害 charm！</><#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">类型：</> 恐龙符咒<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">等级：</> 次级<#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">额外属性加成</><#RN#>将使你的治疗量提升 2 倍","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1814077720",
      "Source": "Congrats! The RNG gods have provided you with a<#RN#> <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Lucky dodge charm!</><#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">Type:</> DinoCharm<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">Rank:</> Lesser<#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">Additional Stat Bonuses</><#RN#>Will give you a chance to dodge!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"恭喜！RNG 之神赐予了你一个<#RN#> <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">幸运闪避 charm！</><#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">类型：</> 恐龙符咒<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">等级：</> 次级<#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">额外属性加成</><#RN#>将给予你闪避的机会！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2779502165",
      "Source": "Congrats! The RNG gods have provided you with a<#RN#> <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Lucky Jump charm!</><#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">Type:</> DinoCharm<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">Rank:</> Lesser<#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">Additional Stat Bonuses</><#RN#>You can now jump x2 higher and take no fall damage from it.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"恭喜！RNG 之神赐予了你一个<#RN#> <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">幸运跳跃 charm！</><#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">类型：</> 恐龙符咒<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">等级：</> 次级<#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">额外属性加成</><#RN#>你现在可以跳得比以前高 2 倍，并且不会因此受到坠落伤害。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1038641783",
      "Source": "Congrats! The RNG gods have provided you with a<#RN#> <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Lucky timestop charm!</><#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">Type:</> DinoCharm<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">Rank:</> Lesser<#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">Additional Stat Bonuses</><#RN#>Has a 10% chance to stop time whenever something hits you!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"恭喜！RNG 之神赐予了你一个<#RN#> <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">幸运时间停止 charm！</><#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">类型：</> 恐龙符咒<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">等级：</> 次级<#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">额外属性加成</><#RN#>当你受到攻击时，有 10% 的概率停止时间！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2654841155",
      "Source": "Congrats! The RNG gods have provided you with a<#RN#> <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Lucky Gravity charm!</><#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">Rank:</> Greater<#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"19,119,179\">Additional Stat Bonuses</><#RN#>Will let you jump as if you are on the moon!",
