    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3133203027",
      "Source": "A floating wooden platform that you can pilot across the water. <#RN#><#RN#>This behemoth sized raft has an inbuild storage system and has 500K health total!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一个你可以驾驶着在水面上行驶的浮动木质平台。 <#RN#><#RN#>这个巨兽大小的木筏有一个内置存储系统，总生命值为 50 万！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1321653744",
      "Source": "A floating wooden platform that you can pilot across the water.  Can support the weight of structures and be built on.<#RN#><#RN#>Has Extra speed and a better turning radius!<#RN#>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一个你可以驾驶着在水面上行驶的浮动木质平台。 可以支撑建筑的重量并在其上建造。<#RN#><#RN#>具有额外速度和更好的转弯半径！<#RN#>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3802003700",
      "Source": "A floating wooden platform that you can pilot across the water.  Can support the weight of structures and be built on.<#RN#><#RN#>Has Extra speed and a better turning radius!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一个你可以驾驶着在水面上行驶的浮动木质平台。 可以支撑建筑的重量并在其上建造。<#RN#><#RN#>具有额外速度和更好的转弯半径！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1561638247",
      "Source": "These incredibly sharp Brass metal spikes have got  x20 the health of normal spikes and blocks bigger creatures from walking over it!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这些极其锋利的黄铜金属尖刺的生命值是普通尖刺的 20 倍，并且可以阻止更大的生物从上面走过！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4285281695",
      "Source": "These incredibly sharp Bronze metal spikes have got  x40 the health of normal spikes and blocks ALL creatures from walking over it!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这些极其锋利的青铜金属尖刺的生命值是普通尖刺的 40 倍，并且可以阻止所有生物从上面走过！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2826022341",
      "Source": "In this egg you can craft your own titan.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在这个蛋里，你可以制作自己的泰坦。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::522856587",
      "Source": "This will spawn a WILD whelpling titan!<#RN#><#RN#>Its only at its first evolution so its not in its current strongest form yet!<#RN#><#RN#>Future updates will allow you to further evolve this into an even bigger beast",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这将生成一只野生幼龙泰坦！<#RN#><#RN#>它仅处于第一次进化阶段，所以尚未达到当前的最强形态！<#RN#><#RN#>未来的更新将允许你进一步将其进化为更大的野兽","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
