    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2084175749",
      "Source": "Congrats on beating Nemesis! However!<#RN#><#RN#> <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">This is only the beginning!!</><#RN#><#RN#>Everything you experienced up until now is only part 1.<#RN#><#RN#>Part 2 will be here soon, and  <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Goliath</> awaits your challenge! I hope to see you back soon Survivor!<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>Btw, If you would like a sneakpeak of Goliath.<#RN#><#RN#>Head over to the modpage and watch the trailer! once the trailer goes dark at the end there is a little teaser hidden away.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"恭喜击败复仇女神！不过！<#RN#><#RN#> <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">这只是开始！！</><#RN#><#RN#>你到目前为止经历的一切都只是第一部分。<#RN#><#RN#>第二部分即将到来，<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">歌利亚</>正等待你的挑战！希望很快能再见到你，幸存者！<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>对了，如果你想先睹歌利亚的风采。<#RN#><#RN#>前往 mod 页面观看预告片！预告片结尾变暗时，有一个小彩蛋隐藏其中。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2835370780",
      "Source": "A heart given by a youngling Titan!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一只幼崽泰坦给予的心！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
